- unset mode defaults to `config`; explicitly empty mode is rejected;
- invalid values are shell-escaped and accepted values are listed;
- `uds-only` prepares `/var/run/gnmi` as `0750` and fails before telemetry if setup fails.

Validation: Bash syntax, mode diagnostics, directory permissions, and `git diff --check` pass.

